=== A. revalidation: unrecognized segment (mv) after an rm row ===
cmd: rm notes.txt; mv important /tmp/important
affected: [{'path': 'notes.txt', 'effect': '삭제'}]
notes: ["'mv important /tmp/important' 부분의 영향은 자동 계산하지 못함. 명령 원문을 확인할 것."]

=== B. rm operand with a space, target exists, no single-word files ===
cmd: rm "final report.docx"
affected: [{'path': 'final report.docx', 'effect': '삭제 시도 (현재 존재하지 않음)'}]
notes: []
target exists: True

=== C. same command, decoy single-word files also exist ===
cmd: rm "final report.docx"
affected: [{'path': 'final', 'effect': '삭제'}, {'path': 'report.docx', 'effect': '삭제'}]
target exists: True

=== D. literal glob metachar in a quoted operand ===
cmd: rm "a*b.txt"
affected: [{'path': 'a*b.txt', 'effect': '삭제'}]

=== E. filename with newline through _expand/_walk ===
expand(*): ['a', 'b', 'ok.txt']
walk(.): ['.', './a', 'b', './ok.txt']
affected: [{'path': '.', 'effect': '삭제'}, {'path': './a', 'effect': '삭제'}, {'path': 'b', 'effect': '삭제'}, {'path': './ok.txt', 'effect': '삭제'}]

